# hardware/.env.example — TEMPLATE. Copy to hardware/.env and fill in your own values.
#   cp hardware/.env.example hardware/.env
#
# .env is git-ignored (never committed). NEVER paste a real token into .env.example
# or into any tracked file. Credentials are read only from the environment (§0).
#
# Get these from https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com (IBM Quantum Platform):
#   IBM_TOKEN : your 44-character API key.
#   IBM_CRN   : the IBM Cloud CRN of your Quantum instance
#               (looks like: crn:v1:bluemix:public:quantum-computing:us-east:a/...::).

IBM_TOKEN=
IBM_CRN=
